WEBVTT

00:22:58.204 --> 00:23:02.663
or art more generally, the movies as
a popular medium is that, you know,

00:23:02.704 --> 00:23:06.329
fortunately we have these virtual spaces
where we can sort of commune around

00:23:06.329 --> 00:23:08.496
them and it's not quite the same,

00:23:08.538 --> 00:23:13.204
but it still ends up being a common
language and a common touch point

00:23:13.954 --> 00:23:16.204
for humankind. Right. You know,

00:23:16.204 --> 00:23:19.538
I think Netflix just put out that they had
seventy eight million people watched

00:23:19.538 --> 00:23:21.454
Gina Prince Bythewood movie The Old Guard.

00:23:21.663 --> 00:23:24.913
And when I meet somebody and
they've watched it also,

00:23:24.913 --> 00:23:28.996
we will have a really positive
conversation about Gina Prince bywords,

00:23:28.996 --> 00:23:31.954
brilliant work, and we will feel
closer as a consequence.